    sa: ["How should Christians read the law of Moses?", ["christ", "fulfil", "character", "principle", "love", "grace"], "A good answer says read it as God's word that reveals his character, points to Christ who fulfils it, and teaches lasting principles of justice and love, not as a way of earning salvation."],
